        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obotomwa bwa Paulo ase abanto b’Ebisaku",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inaki ase ayio inche Paulo nabeire omosibwa o Kristo Yeso ase engencho yaino, inwe abanto b’Ebisaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ekeene mwaigure amang’ana y’oborendi bw’obuya bwa Nyasae, obo naetwe ase engencho yaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase okomaanorerwa nateebetigwe obobisi boria buna nabariikera reero iga ase amang’ana amake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, ekero morayasome, inamonyaare korora okomanya kw’ane kw’obobisi bwa Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obobisi obo Nyasae tamanyetie Mwanyabaanto ase ebigori binde buna bono ase Omoika abaigoreire abatomwa baye abachenu na ababani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obobisi boria nobo, ng’a abanto b’Ebisaku babeire abanyamwando amo naintwe, ebiimo bi’omobere oyomo, na ababwatani amo naintwe ase eira ere ase Kristo Yeso ase enchera y’enchiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo ’ngakorwa koba omosomba bw’enchiri eye koreng’ana nekeegwa ki’obuya bwa Nyasae obo naetwe ase ogokora gw’okobua kwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche inde omoke kobua abachenu bonsi; nonya nabo ’nkaegwa obuya bw’okoranderia abanto b’Ebisaku obonda bwa Kristo, obo botari korengeka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaegwa kobaorokereria abanto bonsi barore omooroberio bw’obobisi boria bwabisetwe korwa kare ase Nyasae, oyotongete ebinto bionsi;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "erinde bono, ase enchera y’ekanisa, obong’aini bwa Nyasae, obore ne chingeencho chinyinge, bomanyekane n’abagaambi na abare nokobua kwa igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo kwareenge okorigia kwaye gwa kare na kare, okwo aikeranetie ase Kristo Yeso, Omonene oito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asere ntore noboremu na ogosemeria kw’ogosoa ase enchera y’okomwegena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaki nabasabire, timokwa emioyo ase engencho y’ogochaandwa kw’ane inde nakwo ase engencho yaino, okore obonene bwaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obwanchani bwa Kristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio namobekeire amaru aane inse Tata,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekiagera bonsi abakorwa ase Tata, abare igoro na abare ase ense, nigo bakorokwa ase erieta riaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasabire ng’a koreng’ana nobonda bw’obonene bwaye, abanchere momentwe chinguru ase okobua goeteera ase Omoika oye ase omonto o ime;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Kristo amenye ase chinkoro chiaino komwamwegenire. Nasabire ng’a inwe komor’abe n’emeri na oboroso ase obwanchani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "monyaare koba ne chinguru ase okomanya amo nabachenu bonsi obogare na obotambe, na gochia igoro, na gochia inse,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na komanya obwanchani bwa Kristo oboetete okomanya, erinde monyaare goichorigwa ogoichorwa gwonsi kwa Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaki, ase are ere oyoranyaare gokora goetania mono kobua aya togosaba gose aya tokorengereria, koreng’ana ne chinguru chigokora emeremo ime ase tore,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ase are ere obonene ase ekanisa na ase Kristo Yeso goika ebigori bionsi kare na kare. Amina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
